  "question": {
    "text": "The motion of a particle varies with time according to the relation <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>ω</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math>",
